  "description": "The Drifter Bar 6000 Prefilled Pod Kit is a compact and rechargeable pod system designed for long-lasting flavour, convenience and value. Offering up to 6000 puffs (depending upon personal usage) per kit, it combines a 2ml prefilled pod with an integrated 10ml auto-refilling e-liquid container, ensuring fewer refills and consistent vapour production alongside significant cost-savings. Powered by a 550mAh rechargeable battery, the Drifter Bar 6K supports USB-C fast charging for minimal downtime. A built-in mesh coil optimises vapour production and flavour intensity, while inhale activation makes vaping intuitive and effortless—just take a puff on the mouthpiece to start vaping. For added security, the Drifter Bar 6K features a triple-tap child lock with haptic feedback, preventing accidental activation when not in use. Tap three times on the Type-C port to lock or unlock your device. With easily replaceable pods and 10 incredible Drifter flavours to choose from, the Drifter Bar 6000 offers a sustainable and cost-effective alternative to single-use disposable vapes. If you’re looking to explore more high-quality devices like this, check out our full range of Prefilled Vapes for a variety of kits and flavours. This makes vaping simple, flexible, and affordable for vapers of all kinds. Drifter 6K Prefilled Pod Kit Flavours Blue Razz Lemonade Blueberry Blueberry Sour Raspberry Cherry Kiwi Passionfruit Guava Lemon & Lime Mango Ice Pineapple Peach Mango Sweet Strawberry Watermelon Ice Shop Drifter 6k Refill Pods",
